cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Doppelstep in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Doppelstep: Zephyr RTOS stepper motor controller seen as a DYNAMIXEL smart servo"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Zephyr RTOS firmware that drives a two-phase stepper motor in closed-loop
  microstepping current control and answers on the bus as a DYNAMIXEL XM430-W350
  (Protocol 2.0). Boards: the STMicroelectronics B-G431B-ESC1 (three half-bridges) and a
  board with two full H-bridges (TI DRV8412) and an MA730 shaft encoder. With an MCUboot
  bootloader, a simulated motor for software-in-the-loop tests, and a bench GUI.
type: software
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
